license: CC BY 2.0 FR
note: The licence rules were read at the pinned tatoeba2 commit on 2026-10-28 (file SHA-256 29293aff34abdc7decb8af8cf7c5e866fae950a19951cdf7800ae893b88b7d03): a sentence is CC BY 2.0 FR or CC0 1.0, and this archive holds the CC BY 2.0 FR ones.
note: The companion CC0 1.0 archive sentences_CC0.tar.bz2 of the same release (SHA-256 74a1577f35d9f11134b281be3125cf17e5531b8a29054f68b3e858418387e17f) is pinned with this one in analysis/train-recipes/tatoeba-export.txt.
note: CC BY 2.0 FR asks for the authors to be credited; the models the recipes train ship the ids of the sentences used, each at tatoeba.org, and reading an export re-checks that the two sentence licences are the only ones.
note: Tatoeba replaces its weekly export at the same addresses, so the pinned copy is the repository release, not downloads.tatoeba.org.
